[38;2;124;124;124mTaking limit as $n \to \infty$: $f_n \to f$ in $L^1(K)$, $f'_n \to g$ in [0m
[38;2;124;124;124m$L^1(K)$, $\varphi, \varphi'$ bounded. So:[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m$$\int f \varphi' = -\int g \varphi$$[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mThis shows $f$ is weakly differentiable with weak derivative $g$.[0m

